["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Liquidating a whale by hand, 22 times margin call DeFi lending protocol wrapped token\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-complexsys-手动清算一个巨鲸的仓位22次-杠杆率只是四年级除法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/869854f30ccd1804-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">22:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>手动清算一个巨鲸的仓位22次：杠杆率只是四年级除法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">FTX崩盘期间，Solend上一个巨鲸账户资不抵债，程序没能自动清算，作者靠手动点按钮22次完成了清算机器人该做的事，顺带赚了约50%收益。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">杠杆</span><span class=\"tag\">DeFi</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Nvidia&#x27;s Megaspeed Scandal Is Really All About NVIDIA Cloud Partner (NCP) AI diffusion rule remote access zero-day inferencing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-oddlots-nvidia对华芯片管控的最大漏洞-不卖芯片-租给你用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">54:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>NVIDIA对华芯片管控的最大漏洞：不卖芯片，租给你用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Megaspeed用46亿美元买进NVIDIA芯片转租阿里巴巴，远程访问不违法；NVIDIA核查后仍有5万块芯片下落不明，部分是最先进的Blackwell。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">芯片出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">NVIDIA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV Special: Measles Mini Symposium EMT (epithelial-mesenchymal transition) cGAS live cell extrusion air-liquid interface culture\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-twiv-麻疹病毒三十年不变异-多突变同时发生在数学上不可能/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>麻疹病毒三十年不变异：多突变同时发生在数学上不可能</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">麻疹是RNA病毒却几乎不变异，因为逃逸疫苗需要F蛋白和H蛋白同时发生多个突变，这在概率上几乎不可能实现，这也是同一支疫苗能用几十年的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗接种率</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Plain of Jars: An Ancient Asian Mystery secondary burial MNI (minimum number of individuals) tooth ablation Secret War\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-ancients-老挝石缸之谜-石器摆在那-人骨却是公元1000年的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ccb88a1d887baf32-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>老挝石缸之谜：石器摆在那，人骨却是公元1000年的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">石缸本身无法直接测年，但缸内外反复出现的人骨、牙齿拔除和1000年前后的年代，说明这套石缸丧葬传统可能一直延续到铁器时代之后很久。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">东南亚考古</span><span class=\"tag\">丧葬习俗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"How Rasputin Destroyed the Romanovs with Anthony Beevor Stavka\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-historyhit-拉斯普京唯一正确的建议-沙皇偏偏没听/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bc43533ed0928f37-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">45:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>拉斯普京唯一正确的建议，沙皇偏偏没听</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">拉斯普京劝沙皇不要参战，这是他少数正确的建议，但沙皇恰恰在军事问题上从不听他的，却在人事任命上对他和皇后言听计从，最终拖垮整个帝国的行政体系。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">俄国革命</span><span class=\"tag\">罗曼诺夫王朝</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"412. Lawrence of Arabia: Guerrilla Warfare In The Arab Revolt (Part 2) Sykes-Picot Treaty Balfour Declaration Hejaz Railway Arab Bureau Seven Pillars of Wisdom\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-empirehist-劳伦斯真正背叛的不是阿拉伯人-而是自己效忠的大英帝国/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">43:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>劳伦斯真正背叛的不是阿拉伯人，而是自己效忠的大英帝国</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英国情报官劳伦斯提前获悉英法瓜分阿拉伯世界的密约后，没有效忠大英帝国，而是告诉费萨尔「不要相信我政府的承诺」，自己先选了边。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">阿拉伯起义</span><span class=\"tag\">劳伦斯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"722. The Charge of the Light Brigade: The Tsar’s Terrible Siege (Part 2) Minié rifle sawback reconnaissance\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-restishistory-俄军已主动撤围-英法却现编了一个入侵克里米亚的理由/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0d69379084116b18-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>俄军已主动撤围，英法却现编了一个入侵克里米亚的理由</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">围攻西利斯特里亚解除后，英法在巴尔干的战争目标其实已经达成，入侵克里米亚、围攻塞瓦斯托波尔只是为了给已经出征的舰队和不满的舆论一个交代。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">克里米亚战争</span><span class=\"tag\">英国军事史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Is it intent or impact that matters in our relationships? (with Shwani Turner) locus of control light gassing PDA (pathological demand avoidance) declarative language decoupling\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-clearerthink-责任不在意图也不在影响-而在于伤害是否可预见/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d6c2f45dd923b89a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Clearer Thinking</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>责任不在意图也不在影响，而在于伤害是否可预见</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">冲人大吼侮辱该自己负责；一句无害的称赞让对方崩溃，那更多是听者自己过去的经历在起作用，不该全算说话人的账。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人际关系</span><span class=\"tag\">自我责任</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"$20M Run Rate, Zero Co-Founders | Ben Cera, Polsia true solo free solo juiced solo\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-solofounders-零联合创始人-一人公司把年化收入做到2000万美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/347f00c2fdab662f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">43:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">单人创始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>零联合创始人，一人公司把年化收入做到2000万美元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">靠的不是秘密武器，而是他直接跳过了「找联合创始人」这一步——他认为多数联合创始人只是创始人图安心找的保险，真到决策时反而互相拖后腿。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">单人创始人</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.281 小历史 | 1998，宝马和大众瓜分劳斯莱斯 first and final bid\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-bizthisway-大众花4-3亿英镑买下劳斯莱斯-却买不到这个名字/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6fd1ebf29b7a3afa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"商\"><span class=\"dur\">41:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">商业就是这样</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>大众花4.3亿英镑买下劳斯莱斯，却买不到这个名字</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">劳斯莱斯的商标权自1971年拆分起就不归造车的公司所有，大众砸下4.3亿英镑买下工厂与宾利，却买不到劳斯莱斯这个名字，最终只能让给宝马。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">并购</span><span class=\"tag\">品牌授权</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Mapping Humanity From Space: NASA’s Black Marble with Dr. Miguel Román Black Marble Golden Goose Award VIIRS nadir downscaling\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-fromfirstprinc-被当成仪器故障的数据异常-竟是开罗城在斋月里的灯光变化/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/59727fbf3d73d196-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">48:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From First Principles</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>被当成仪器故障的数据异常，竟是开罗城在斋月里的灯光变化</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">团队原以为是仪器故障，耗费数年排查后才发现，开罗、安曼等城市的夜间亮度是按伊斯兰历而非公历波动的，异常曲线精确对上了斋月的开斋节。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">卫星遥感</span><span class=\"tag\">夜间灯光数据</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"#889: Q&amp;A with Tim — How to Get Unstuck, Resilience in Hard Times, Tools for Brain Health, Finding Inner Peace, Optimism as a Learnable Skill, and More IFS (Internal Family Systems) fear setting hemoglobin A1c Zone 2 training\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-timferriss-行动的风险被高估了-不行动的代价才被低估/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4859313b1789a4e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Tim Ferriss</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>行动的风险被高估了，不行动的代价才被低估</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">写下一年、三年、十年不改变会发生什么，那幅画面通常比你想象中更可怕——这比盘算风险更能推动你做出真正的改变。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行为改变</span><span class=\"tag\">阿尔茨海默病预防</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Too dry for cacti: extreme droughts could push iconic species to extinction severe drought model CAD obesity (combined anthropometric definition of obesity) IUCN Red List\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-naturepod-仙人掌没你想得那么耐旱-极端干旱下四分之一物种会丢掉八成栖息地/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b247947db171866-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">24:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>仙人掌没你想得那么耐旱：极端干旱下四分之一物种会丢掉八成栖息地</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">仙人掌被当作抗旱标杆，但研究者把极端干旱纳入气候模型后发现，近四分之一物种将损失超过八成适宜栖息地，远超常规气候模型的预测。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">气候变化</span><span class=\"tag\">生物多样性</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"A New Vision for Human Work After Automation GDPval agency rupture allocation economy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-aiandi-ai-让生成答案变得廉价-稀缺的是你带着视角去追问/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8c79a115d7e2b3b6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">26:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I（Every）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>AI 让生成答案变得廉价，稀缺的是你带着视角去追问</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">当所有人都能从 Claude 拿到同样的默认答案，真正值钱的不是模型能力本身，而是你因为责任和视角而去追问出的那个不一样的答案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 自动化</span><span class=\"tag\">未来工作</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Credit Cards EMV chip Charga-Plate coverture usury law Fresno Drop\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-stuffmissed-美国银行1958年给整座城市邮寄6万张信用卡-不用申请/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>美国银行1958年给整座城市邮寄6万张信用卡，不用申请</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1958年美国银行给弗雷斯诺6万居民直接寄去信用卡，不问资质、没有申请——这场豪赌几乎让银行赔到破产，却意外开启了全国性信用卡时代。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信用卡</span><span class=\"tag\">消费金融</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Agents That Think Together: Cisco&#x27;s Vijoy Pandey on Semantic Alignment, Scope, Accord &amp; Concord Internet of Cognition Scope Accord / Concord GATs / COGs neuralese / latent space communication\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-cogrev-多智能体系统仪表盘全绿-但任务完成率为零/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0ad67f662e5c86c3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>多智能体系统仪表盘全绿，但任务完成率为零</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Cisco发现一个多智能体系统在仪表盘上显示66%在线、运行正常，实际任务完成率却是0%——因为现有监控只检查连接状态，不检查语义是否对齐。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">多智能体系统</span><span class=\"tag\">企业AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What the Internet Boom Teaches Us About the AI Buildout | Mike Volpi WDM stat-muxing neocloud KV cache model router\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-a16z-ai算力终将被用尽-但资产的主人很可能会换人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">56:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>AI算力终将被用尽，但资产的主人很可能会换人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">上一轮光纤泡沫里，负债最重的公司率先破产，但光纤资产被别人接手后照样好用；Mike Volpi 认为这轮 GPU 建设会重演同一剧本——资产会被充分利用，归属权却很可能换人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力周期</span><span class=\"tag\">GPU资产</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.135律政佳人转行卖馒头 年入4亿 聊聊早餐创新的秘密 PB\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-nengzheduolao-水饺有巨头-包子馒头没有-因为机器学不会捏褶子的手感/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/08bfa83c9f3d2123-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"能\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">能者多唠｜商业原声</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>水饺有巨头，包子馒头没有，因为机器学不会捏褶子的手感</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">水饺汤圆早被思念三全这样的巨头规模化吃下，包子馒头却因为发面要靠手工捏褶，机械做不出那种蓬松感，十年来始终留给小品牌生存空间。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">食品消费</span><span class=\"tag\">供应链</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Zach Reitano - Building Ro and Why Healthcare Should Be 50% of GDP - [Invest Like the Best, EP.500] PBM Overton window demand aggregator strong attract, strong repel\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-ilt-美国医疗的核心病根-病人掏钱-却从来不是真正的客户/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c02f9f6b43abc39b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>美国医疗的核心病根：病人掏钱，却从来不是真正的客户</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ro创始人认为医疗支出该尽量高，因为真问题不是花了多少钱，而是病人从没当过真正的客户——GLP-1用现金自付证明了这一点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医疗</span><span class=\"tag\">GLP-1</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Perfect Storm That Clobbered Hedge Funds multi-strat / pod negative gamma CTA de-grossing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-oddlots-标榜-不相关-的对冲基金-十月却因同押ai集体巨亏/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">51:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>标榜「不相关」的对冲基金，十月却因同押AI集体巨亏</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">十月里几乎所有主流策略的对冲基金同时亏钱，说明过去一年多数人赚的其实是隐性做多AI的钱，而非真正分散的策略收益。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">对冲基金</span><span class=\"tag\">多策略基金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Chickenology (HENS &amp; ROOSTERS) Part 2 Encore with Tove Danovich pecking order lash egg bumblefoot broody gizzard\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-ologies-公鸡其实没有阴茎-一个叫bmp4的蛋白质在胚胎期把它杀死了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">47:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>公鸡其实没有阴茎：一个叫BMP4的蛋白质在胚胎期把它杀死了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">鸡蛋的颜色、受精与否、营养价值几乎都由品种决定而非「天然程度」，但工业化养殖为效率牺牲了孵蛋本能，也让断喙和啄癖成为普遍争议。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">后院养鸡</span><span class=\"tag\">动物行为</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.35 对话朱啸虎：Personal Agent 是个伪需求？ Personal Agent ARR Vibe Coding Open-weight model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-guijilichang-你自己都没有秘书-为什么需要一个ai秘书/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/38d8d27c2f34d3c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">22:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">硅基立场</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>你自己都没有秘书，为什么需要一个AI秘书</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">朱啸虎认为日常工作99.9%不需要顶级大模型，开源模型的token消耗量终将超过闭源；但Personal Agent缺少高频场景，很可能重蹈十年前补贴打车的覆辙。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI应用</span><span class=\"tag\">基座模型经济学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"20.建筑师戚山山：人生不是“既要又要还要”，而是“我就要这个” safe play\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-tanpai-建筑师不与别人竞争-只跟一百个自己赛跑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/68d3da25c54fc635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"摊\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">摊牌｜创业观察</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>建筑师不与别人竞争，只跟一百个自己赛跑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她说自己从不觉得在卷，是因为压根没有要卷的对象——建筑师戚山山的生命力不是自律撑出来的，而是先问自己到底喜不喜欢，再决定做不做。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">建筑</span><span class=\"tag\">女性创业者</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Freedom vs. Safety: Axon CEO Rick Smith on the Future of Policing ALPR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-allin-axon-ceo-警用无人机未来该配非致命武器-而不是枪/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/561dcd474c610c53-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">55:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>Axon CEO:警用无人机未来该配非致命武器，而不是枪</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Axon 主张用无人机和机器人搭载非致命武器取代警察持枪对峙，开火权仍归人类，但要多人实时审批才能启动。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">安防科技</span><span class=\"tag\">创业史</span>\n</div></div></a>"]